#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:2
msgid "Configuring your Android Devices"
msgstr "Androidデバイスの構成"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:5
msgid "What Needs to Be Configured for My Control System?"
msgstr "私の制御システムに必要な構成は何ですか？"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:8
msgid "Driver Hub Configuration"
msgstr "Driver Hub 構成"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:10
msgid ""
"Teams who are using the REV Robotics Driver Hub as their DRIVER STATION "
"should refer to the `official documentation from REV Robotics "
"<https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-control/driver-hub-gs>`_ for instructions "
"on how to set up and use the REV Robotics Driver Hub."
msgstr ""
"REV Robotics Driver HubをDRIVER STATIONとして使用しているチームは、REV Robotics Driver "
"Hubの設定と使用方法についての指示を `official documentation from REV Robotics "
"<https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-control/driver-hub-gs>`_ を参照してください。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:15
msgid "Control Hub Configuration"
msgstr "Control Hub 構成"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:18
msgid ""
"References to the DRIVER STATION smartphone may instead apply to the `REV "
"Robotics Driver Hub <https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-control/control-"
"system-overview/driver-hub-specifications>`__, which is preloaded with the "
"Driver Station (DS) app."
msgstr ""
"DRIVER STATIONスマートフォンへの参照は、Driver Station (DS)アプリがプリロードされた `REV Robotics "
"Driver Hub <https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-control/control-system-"
"overview/driver-hub-specifications>`__に適用される場合があります。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:22
msgid ""
"Teams who are using a Control Hub (which has an integrated Android Device) "
"will only need to configure a single smartphone for use as a DRIVER STATION."
" The process is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Control Hub（統合されたAndroidデバイスを搭載している）を使用しているチームは、DRIVER "
"STATIONとして使用するために単一のスマートフォンを構成するだけで済みます。プロセスは以下の通りです："

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:25
msgid ""
"Rename the smartphone to \"<TEAM NUMBER>-DS\" (where <TEAM NUMBER> is "
"replaced by your team number)."
msgstr ""
"スマートフォンの名前を「<TEAM NUMBER>-DS」に変更してください（<TEAM NUMBER>はあなたのチーム番号に置き換えてください）。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:26
msgid ""
"Install the Driver Station (DS) app onto the DRIVER STATION device. (The DS "
"app is pre-installed on the REV Robotics Driver Hub.)"
msgstr ""
"DRIVER STATIONデバイスにDriver Station (DS)アプリをインストールします。（DSアプリはREV Robotics "
"Driver Hubにプリインストールされています。）"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:27
msgid "Put your phone into Airplane Mode (with the WiFi radio still on)."
msgstr "電話を機内モードに設定してください（WiFiラジオはオンのままにしてください）。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:28
msgid "Pair (i.e., wirelessly connect) the DRIVER STATION to the Control Hub."
msgstr "DRIVER STATIONをControl Hubにペアリング（つまり、ワイヤレス接続）します。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:35
msgid ""
"Eventually the Control Hub will need to be renamed so that its name complies"
" with the Competition Manual, but for now we will use the Control Hub with "
"its default name. You can learn how to manage a Control Hub (and modify its "
"name, password, etc.) in :doc:`this tutorial "
"<../managing_control_hub/Managing-a-Control-Hub>`."
msgstr ""
"最終的にControl Hubは競技マニュアルに準拠するように名前を変更する必要がありますが、現時点ではデフォルト名のControl "
"Hubを使用します。Control Hubの管理方法（名前やパスワードなどの変更方法）については、 :doc:`this tutorial "
"<../managing_control_hub/Managing-a-Control-Hub>` で学ぶことができます。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:42
msgid "Two Android Smartphone Configuration"
msgstr "二台のAndroidスマートフォンの構成"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:44
msgid ""
"Teams who have two smartphones and are not using a Control Hub will need to "
"configure one smartphone for use as a Robot Controller and a second "
"smartphone for use as an DRIVER STATION. The process is as follows,"
msgstr ""
"2台のスマートフォンを持ち、Control Hubを使用していないチームは、1台のスマートフォンをRobot "
"Controllerとして使用するように構成し、もう1台のスマートフォンをDRIVER "
"STATIONとして使用するように構成する必要があります。プロセスは以下の通りです、"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:48
msgid ""
"Rename one smartphone to \"<TEAM NUMBER>-RC\" (replace <TEAM NUMBER> with "
"your team number)."
msgstr ""
"スマートフォンの名前を「<TEAM NUMBER>-RC」に変更します（<TEAM NUMBER>をあなたのチーム番号に置き換えてください）。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:49
msgid "Install the Robot Controller app onto the Robot Controller phone."
msgstr "Robot ControllerアプリをRobot Controllerの電話にインストールしてください。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:50
msgid ""
"Rename a second smartphone to \"<TEAM NUMBER>-DS\" (where <TEAM NUMBER> is "
"replaced by your team number)."
msgstr ""
"2台目のスマートフォンの名前を「<TEAM NUMBER>-DS」に変更します（<TEAM NUMBER>はあなたのチーム番号に置き換えます）。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:51
msgid ""
"Install the Driver Station app onto the DRIVER STATION device. (The DS app "
"is pre-installed on the REV Robotics Driver Hub.)"
msgstr ""
"DRIVER STATION デバイスに Driver Station アプリをインストールします。（DS アプリは REV Robotics "
"Driver Hub にプリインストールされています。）"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:52
msgid "Put your phones into Airplane Mode (with the WiFi radios still on)."
msgstr "携帯電話を機内モードに設定してください（WiFiラジオはオンのままにします）。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:53
msgid ""
"Pair (i.e., wirelessly connect) the DRIVER STATION to the Robot Controller."
msgstr "DRIVER STATIONをRobot Controllerにペアリング（つまり、ワイヤレス接続）します。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:63
msgid "Renaming Your Smartphones"
msgstr "スマートフォンの名前を変更する"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:65
msgid ""
"The official rules of the *FIRST* Tech Challenge (see R707) require that you"
" change the Wi-Fi name of your smartphones to include your team number and "
"\"-RC\" if the phone is a Robot Controller or \"-DS\" if it is a DRIVER "
"STATION. A team can insert an additional dash and a letter (\"A\", \"B\", "
"\"C\", etc.) if the team has more than one set of Android phones."
msgstr ""
"*FIRST* Tech Challengeの公式ルール（R707を参照）では、スマートフォンのWi-Fi名をチーム番号と「-RC」（電話がRobot "
"Controllerの場合）または「-DS」（電話がDRIVER "
"STATIONの場合）を含むように変更する必要があります。チームが複数のAndroidフォンのセットを持っている場合、追加のダッシュと文字（「A」、「B」、「C」など）を挿入することができます。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:70
msgid ""
"If, for example, a team has a team number of 9999 and the team has multiple "
"sets of phones, the team might decide to name one phone \"9999-C-RC\" for "
"the Robot Controller and the other phone \"9999-C-DS\" for the DRIVER "
"STATION. The \"-C\" indicates that these devices belong to the third set of "
"phones for this team."
msgstr ""
"例えば、チーム番号が9999のチームが複数の電話セットを持っている場合、チームは1つの電話を「9999-C-RC」と名付けてロボットコントローラー用とし、もう1つの電話を「9999-C-DS」と名付けてDRIVER"
" STATION用とすることを決定するかもしれません。「-C」は、これらのデバイスがこのチームの3番目の電話セットに属していることを示しています。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:76
msgid ""
"The name of a Robot Controller phone can be changed in the RC app, using "
"instructions :ref:`found here "
"<programming_resources/shared/managing_smartphone_rc/Managing-a-Smartphone-"
"Robot-Controller:changing the name>`. It can also be changed at the *Manage*"
" page from the RC app, a paired DS app, or a connected laptop; click ``Apply"
" Wi-Fi Settings`` when done."
msgstr ""
"Robot Controllerの電話の名前は、RCアプリで :ref:`found here "
"<programming_resources/shared/managing_smartphone_rc/Managing-a-Smartphone-"
"Robot-Controller:changing the name>` "
"の指示を使用して変更できます。また、RCアプリ、ペアリングされたDSアプリ、または接続されたPCの *Manage* "
"ページでも変更できます。完了したら、 ``Apply Wi-Fi Settings`` をクリックしてください。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:81
msgid ""
"The name of a DRIVER STATION device can be changed in the DS app, using "
"instructions :ref:`found here "
"<programming_resources/shared/managing_smartphone_ds/Managing-a-Smartphone-"
"Driver-Station:changing the name>`."
msgstr ""
"DRIVER STATIONデバイスの名前は、DSアプリで :ref:`found here "
"<programming_resources/shared/managing_smartphone_ds/Managing-a-Smartphone-"
"Driver-Station:changing the name>` の指示を使用して変更できます。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:85
msgid ""
"As an alternate, the device names can be changed at the Android system "
"level, as described below."
msgstr "代替として、デバイス名は以下に記載されているように、Androidシステムレベルで変更することができます。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:88
msgid "It will take an estimated 5 minutes per phone to complete this task."
msgstr "この作業を完了するには、1台の電話につき約5分かかると見込まれています。"

