#: ../../source/programming_resources/shared/configuring_android/Configuring-Your-Android-Devices.rst:313
msgid ""
"It takes approximately 18 seconds for the Control Hub to power on. The "
"Control Hub is ready to pair with the Driver Station when the LED turns "
"green. Note: the light blinks blue every ~5 seconds to indicate that the "
"Control Hub is healthy."
msgstr ""
"Control Hubの電源が入るまでに約18秒かかります。LEDが緑色に点灯すると、Control HubはDriver "
"Stationとペアリングする準備が整ったことを示します。注意：Control Hubが正常であることを示すために、約5秒ごとに青色に点滅します。"

